 # AGENTS.md
 
 vault-mcp-server is the SOLE integration hub of the vault family. Cross-domain work (notes + calendar + tasks views, agent access, new sources) lands here. timeblocks-app is a domain service this hub consumes via a small tool/API — never widen a domain service sideways.
+
+## Commands
+
+- `python tasks.py check` — the one command to run before pushing: `npm ci` from the lockfile, then the full vitest suite.
+- `python tasks.py test` — the vitest suite only (`npm test` → `vitest run`).
+- `python tasks.py run` — start the compiled server (`npm start` → `node dist/server.js`).
+- `npm run build` — TypeScript compile (`tsc`) into `dist/`.
+- `npm run dev` — run `src/server.ts` straight from source with `tsx`.
